      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The once-mighty city of Miragliano was the most powerful Tilean city, but its fate is now uncertain since it was overwhelmed by an army of Skaven in 2522. Many Tileans believe Miragliano will be rebuilt in a few years; meanwhile others claim it will take decades, or will never happen. Much like the regions of the Empire devastated by the Storm of Chaos, the ruined city of Miragliano would make an ideal starting place for adventurers thrown together by fate.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></p>"
      },
