      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<div class=\"subtitle\"><p>The Marsh City - Now in Ruins</p></div><div class=\"legend\"><p><strong>Settlement Size:</strong> CS=City State (any size), T=Town (1000-10000), ST=Small Town (100-1000), V=Village (1-100), F=Fort (any size)</p><p><strong>Wealth:</strong> 1=Impoverished, 2=Poor, 3=Average, 4=Prosperous, 5=Very Rich</p><p><strong>Garrison/Militia Quality:</strong> A=Excellent, B=Average, C=Poor</p></div><table><thead><tr><th><p>Name</p></th><th><p>Size</p></th><th><p>Ruler</p></th><th><p>Population/p&gt;</p></th><th><p>Garrison</p></th><th><p>Wealth</p></th><th><p>Economy</p></th><th><p>Notes</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"capital-row\"><td><p><strong>Miragliano</strong></p></td><td><p><span class=\"size-cs\">CS</span></p></td><td><p>Duce Vincenzo Cornuti</p></td><td><p>93,000</p></td><td><p>200a / 400b / 2600c</p></td><td><p><span class=\"wealth-5\">5</span></p></td><td><p>Trade, Boatbuilding, Government, Fishing</p></td><td><p>Capital - Razed by Skaven 2522</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>Toscania</strong></p></td><td><p><span class=\"size-cs\">CS</span></p></td><td><p>Duchesa Patrizia Malpighi</p></td><td><p>8,700</p></td><td><p>150a / 2000c</p></td><td><p><span class=\"wealth-3\">3</span></p></td><td><p>Trade, Wine, Ore, Goats</p></td><td><p>Semi-independent city-state</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>Olino</strong></p></td><td><p><span class=\"size-t\">T</span></p></td><td><p>Conte Silvio Donati</p></td><td><p>4,600</p></td><td><p>50b / 350c</p></td><td><p><span class=\"wealth-3\">3</span></p></td><td><p>Agriculture, Trade, Wine</p></td><td><p>Northern gateway town</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>Firento</strong></p></td><td><p><span class=\"size-t\">T</span></p></td><td><p>Contessa Marina Foscari</p></td><td><p>4,100</p></td><td><p>45b / 300c</p></td><td><p><span class=\"wealth-3\">3</span></p></td><td><p>Trade, Textiles, Wine</p></td><td><p>Major inland town</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>Udolpho</strong></p></td><td><p><