><strong>Ravola</strong></p></td><td><p><span class=\"size-st\">ST</span></p></td><td><p>Contessa Patrizia Malpighi</p></td><td><p>850</p></td><td><p>25b / 35c</p></td><td><p><span class=\"wealth-2\">2</span></p></td><td><p>Wine, Agriculture</p></td><td><p></p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Smaller Settlements</h3><table><thead><tr><th><p><span style=\"color:white\">Name</span></p></th><th><p><span style=\"color:white\">Size</span></p></th><th><p><span style=\"color:white\">Est. Population</span></p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p>Frago</p></td><td><p><span class=\"size-st\">ST</span></p></td><td><p>420</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Vedona</p></td><td><p><span class=\"size-st\">ST</span></p></td><td><p>380</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Barzo</p></td><td><p><span class=\"size-v\">V</span></p></td><td><p>95</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Foppa</p></td><td><p><span class=\"size-st\">ST</span></p></td><td><p>340</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Lazatta</p></td><td><p><span class=\"size-v\">V</span></p></td><td><p>75</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Belunno</p></td><td><p><span class=\"size-st\">ST</span></p></td><td><p>450</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Seregno</p></td><td><p><span class=\"size-st\">ST</span></p></td><td><p>390</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Renate</p></td><td><p><span class=\"size-v\">V</span></p></td><td><p>85</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Urio</p></td><td><p><span class=\"size-v\">V</span></p></td><td><p>70</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Malonno</p></td><td><p><span class=\"size-st\">ST</span></p></td><td><p>310</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Erba</p></td><td><p><span class=\"size-st\">ST</span></p></td><td><p>280</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Breno</p></td><td><p><span class=\"size-v\">V</span></p></td><td><p>90</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Cundo</p></td><td><p><span class=\"size-v\">V</span></p></td><td><p>65</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Braone</p></td><td><p><span class=\"size-v\">V</span></p></td><td><p>55</p></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"note\"><p><strong>Pre-2522 Total Population:</strong> ~145,000. Following the Skaven destruction of Miragliano in 2522, this territory is largely abandoned or contested. Refugees fled primarily to Catrazza, Urbino, and Tobaro. Toscania remains independent. Other settlements are either destroyed, occupied by Skaven remnants, or have declared independence/allegiance to neighboring powers.</p></div>"
